// Interpolation keeps its earlier overflow and division failures, signed division and aliasing: every non-failing endpoint/divisor/mode case (a hash of the results from an exact oracle) and samples of each failure, optimized.
//@ slow
//@ opt: O3
//@ reason: the optimizer must keep the failures and values of the unoptimized program
